    "start": 485.08,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "\"That man's a loon."
  },
  {
    "start": 487.44,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "Get him out of there before he kills us"
  },
  {
    "start": 489.68,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "all.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 490.76,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Nobody says this."
  },
  {
    "start": 492.88,
    "duration": 5.8,
    "text": "Sorry, this is not a partisan statement."
  },
  {
    "start": 495.08,
    "duration": 5.4,
    "text": "I've hated all our recent presidents."
  },
  {
    "start": 498.68,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Because they don't make us safe. They"
  },
  {
    "start": 500.48,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "don't tell the truth."
  },
  {
    "start": 502.16,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "But this is something absolutely"
  },
  {
    "start": 504.68,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "different what's happening right now."
  },
  {
    "start": 507.28,
    "duration": 6.4,
    "text": "And it's all normalized."
  },
  {
    "start": 510.96,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "And the New York Times story today, all"
  },
  {
    "start": 513.68,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "I do"
  },
  {
    "start": 514.96,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "these days is write irate letters to the"
  },
  {
    "start": 517.52,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "reporters"
  },
  {
    "start": 518.84,
    "duration": 4.639,
    "text": "whom I've known for decades and they"
  },
  {
    "start": 520.52,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "don't write back."
  },
  {
    "start": 523.479,
    "duration": 4.161,
    "text": "Because they don't have the dignity to"
  },
  {
    "start": 525.44,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "get into a serious discussion on"
  },
  {
    "start": 527.64,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "anything."
  },
  {
    "start": 529.64,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "Sometimes, by the way, they write back"
  },
  {
    "start": 531.52,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "and they say, \"Yeah, I agree with you,"
  },
  {
    "start": 533.56,
    "duration": 5.279,
    "text": "Jeff, but higher-ups edit my article."
  },
  {
    "start": 536.28,
    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "So, that's the main thing.\" That it's"
  },
  {
    "start": 538.839,
    "duration": 4.601,
    "text": "complete shutdown of truth at The New"
  },
  {
    "start": 541.28,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "York Times, which used to be my go-to"
  },
  {
    "start": 543.44,
    "duration": 6.24,
    "text": "place to get just a straight story. It's"
  },
  {
    "start": 546.4,
    "duration": 6.52,
    "text": "useless, completely useless right now."
  },
  {
    "start": 549.68,
    "duration": 5.36,
    "text": "But anyway, this story was uh"
  },
  {
    "start": 552.92,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "\"Yes, will Donald Trump be able to"
  },
  {
    "start": 555.04,
    "duration": 5.28,
    "text": "negotiate a deal?\""
  },
  {
    "start": 556.92,
    "duration": 7.44,
    "text": "Without mentioning how weird it is"
  },
  {
    "start": 560.32,
    "duration": 6.36,
    "text": "that there were no negotiations."
  },
  {
    "start": 564.36,
    "duration": 5.72,
    "text": "But he said that there were. That's the"
  },
  {
    "start": 566.68,
    "duration": 6.12,
    "text": "real story of the last day."
  },
  {
    "start": 570.08,
    "duration": 4.759,
    "text": "That's the really interesting story."
  },
  {
    "start": 572.8,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "Were there negotiations?"
  },
  {
    "start": 574.839,
    "duration": 5.601,
    "text": "The story said, this is David Sanger."
  },
  {
    "start": 577.64,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "He's an experienced journalist, 40"
  },
  {
    "start": 580.44,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "years.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 581.52,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "He says, \"Well, Donald Trump didn't tell"
  },
  {
    "start": 583.68,
    "duration": 5.08,
    "text": "us who he was negotiating with.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 586.28,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "David,"
  },
  {
    "start": 588.76,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "come on."
  },
  {
    "start": 590.72,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "Are you serious? You're going to write"
  },
  {
    "start": 593.16,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "that to me?"
  },
  {
    "start": 594.88,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "He didn't tell who he was negotiating"
  },
  {
    "start": 597.04,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "with? Maybe, David, he wasn't"
  },
  {
    "start": 598.96,
    "duration": 5.32,
    "text": "negotiating with anybody."
  },
  {
    "start": 601.36,
    "duration": 5.32,
    "text": "Maybe he made it up. Can't you ask a"
  },
  {
    "start": 604.28,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "question as a grown-up"
  },
  {
    "start": 606.68,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "writing for the New York Times, who's"
  },
  {
    "start": 608.52,
    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "been doing this for 40 years? So, I"
  },
  {
    "start": 610.92,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "wrote to David this morning. I will not"
  },
  {
    "start": 613.52,
    "duration": 5.48,
    "text": "hear back from David."
  },
  {
    "start": 615.2,
    "duration": 6.32,
    "text": "I've known David for probably 40 years."
  },
  {
    "start": 619.0,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Because they don't talk. Because we're"
  },
  {
    "start": 621.52,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "in"
  },
  {
    "start": 622.64,
    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "really a crazy land right now,"
  },
  {
    "start": 625.44,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "where anything goes."
  },
  {
    "start": 627.64,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "And the whole story is, \"Well, what will"
  },
  {
    "start": 629.76,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "Donald Trump do next?\" As if this is a"
  },
  {
    "start": 632.28,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "spectator sport."
  },
  {
    "start": 634.28,
    "duration": 5.76,
    "text": "Not your life and not my life."
  },
  {
    "start": 638.56,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "I'm more interested, when are they going"
  },
  {
    "start": 640.04,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "to take him away?"
  },
  {
    "start": 642.44,
    "duration": 6.24,
    "text": "Before he does more harm to us."
  },
  {
    "start": 646.32,
    "duration": 6.28,
    "text": "When is some grown-up going to say,"
  },
  {
    "start": 648.68,
    "duration": 8.88,
    "text": "\"This is a very bad idea.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 652.6,
    "duration": 8.56,
    "text": "Okay. So, that's the immediate issue."
  },
  {
    "start": 657.56,
    "duration": 6.96,
    "text": "But the system is more deeply broken."
  },
  {
    "start": 661.16,
    "duration": 5.76,
    "text": "There are no checks on presidential"
  },
  {
    "start": 664.52,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "power to launch wars."
  },
  {
    "start": 666.92,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "And there haven't been for decades,"
  },
  {
    "start": 669.4,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "actually."
  },
  {
    "start": 671.56,
    "duration": 5.88,
    "text": "Congress basically doesn't exist when it"
  },
  {
    "start": 674.08,
    "duration": 7.12,
    "text": "comes to foreign policy."
  },
  {
    "start": 677.44,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "It basically doesn't exist."
  },
  {
    "start": 681.2,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "Because"
  },
  {
    "start": 682.4,
    "duration": 5.52,
    "text": "we live in a security state."
  },
  {
    "start": 685.76,
    "duration": 6.36,
    "text": "Foreign policy is carried out by the"
  },
  {
    "start": 687.92,
    "duration": 7.92,
    "text": "CIA, the National Security Agency,"
  },
  {
    "start": 692.12,
    "duration": 6.92,
    "text": "the National Security Council."
  },
  {
    "start": 695.84,
    "duration": 5.56,
    "text": "It's not carried out by anything"
  },
  {
    "start": 699.04,
    "duration": 5.28,
    "text": "resembling democratic institutions at"
  },
  {
    "start": 701.4,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "all. You may say, of course, Jeff, I had"
  },
  {
    "start": 704.32,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "to come here to learn that."
  },
  {
    "start": 706.2,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "But,"
  },
  {
    "start": 707.36,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "it's rather alarming, actually, because"
  },
  {
    "start": 710.52,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "it's not"
  },
  {
    "start": 712.0,
    "duration": 5.84,
    "text": "only 2003,"
  },
  {
    "start": 714.52,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "we're in nonstop wars."
  },
  {
    "start": 717.84,
    "duration": 5.4,
    "text": "Nonstop."
  },
  {
    "start": 719.48,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "It's not just the Iraq war."
  }
]